    "identifier": "lyonesse-the-archangel-chains-of-penitence-chains-of-penitence",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While in your Avatar of the Archangel form, when you hit a creature with an attack, you can force it to make a Strength saving throw against your spell save DC. On a failure, it is Restrained until the end of your next turn as spectral chains lash around it. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Charisma modifier (minimum of once).</p>"
